{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "20歳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "宮地すみれです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "18th Single"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなた坂46 ˹風にキンモクセイ˼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミュージックビデオが公開されました︎︎︎︎。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobqcy2d3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobDlsYj5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/moblHvppw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobXhcSqH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobk5MswX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みつあみ おそろいしたよ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobKa5I2G.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいい みんな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "˹ひなた坂46アイドル強化合宿˼を舞台に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちのひと夏の終わりを描いた"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "秋めくMVになっております🍂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮影では自由にうごいてください~な"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "場面が多く、各々の自然体な表情が"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "生き生きとしたMVで、素敵だなと..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は2Cのおひさま笑顔選手権が好きで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの˹可愛い˼で画面がいっぱいに"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埋め尽くされていて、良きです︎☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブルラズオマージュの冒頭"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は˹君を覚えてない˼のポーズにしました︎︎。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の成長とファンの方への感謝を込めて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優柔不断な私ですが"}, {"type":